+\node[card,below=2.0cm of n0] (n1) {\heading{02}{小平次元0の非零代表元を排除する}{Exclude a nonzero representative in Kodaira dimension zero}$\kappa(D)=0,\ M\ne0\ \Longrightarrow\ G=qM_*\ne0,\quad\operatorname{Supp}G\subset\lfloor C_*\rfloor.$};
