+<!doctype html><html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>07 · Supported lifting — OpenAI Math Digest</title><style>:root{--ink:#25322f;--link:#246657;--paper:#faf9f5;--line:#c6d2cc;--muted:#52615b}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.95 Georgia,"Times New Roman","Yu Mincho","Hiragino Mincho ProN",serif}header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:9;background:rgba(250,249,245,.98);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px max(18px,calc((100% - 1020px)/2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font:15px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Hiragino Sans",sans-serif}.brand{font-weight:650}.langs{display:flex;gap:14px;white-space:nowrap}a{color:var(--link);text-underline-offset:3px}main{max-width:1020px;margin:auto;padding:24px 24px 70px}.notice{font:13px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Hiragino Sans",sans-serif;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px 20px;padding:15px 0 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:14px/1.7 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Hiragino Sans",sans-serif}nav a{padding:8px 10px;background:white;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--line)}nav a[aria-current=page]{border-color:var(--link);background:#eef4f0;font-weight:700}article{margin:auto;max-width:900px}h1{font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,39px);line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;margin:35px 0 22px}h2{font-size:25px;font-weight:500;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:22px;margin-top:40px;line-height:1.55}h3{font-size:20px;line-height:1.6}p{margin:1em 0}blockquote{margin:24px 0;padding:1px 20px;border-left:3px solid var(--line);font:14px/1.8 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Hiragino Sans",sans-serif;color:var(--muted)}figure{margin:25px 0;overflow-x:auto}figure svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;background:white}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}th,td{padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;vertical-align:top}code{font-size:.85em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}mjx-container{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden}.math-display{text-align:center;margin:24px 0;overflow:auto}footer{margin-top:45px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:15px;font:12px/1.7 sans-serif;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:620px){body{font-size:16px}main{padding:16px 16px 45px}header{font-size:13px}nav{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:5px}h2{font-size:22px}figure{margin-left:-8px;margin-right:-8px}table{display:block;overflow:auto}}</style><script>window.MathJax={tex:{inlineMath:[['\\(','\\)']],displayMath:[['\\[','\\]']],processEscapes:true},svg:{fontCache:'global'},options:{skipHtmlTags:['script','noscript','style','textarea','pre','code','svg']}};</script><script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js"></script></head><body><header><span class="brand">OpenAI Math Digest</span><div class="langs"><a href="preview.ja.html" lang="ja">日本語</a><a href="preview.en.html" lang="en">English</a></div></header><main><div class="notice">窓口A · カタログ034 · 未公開初稿の閲覧版</div><nav aria-label="担当4本の記事"><a href="../uniform-pluricanonical-iitaka/preview.ja.html">10 · Uniform Iitaka</a><a href="../lifting-adjoint-sections/preview.ja.html" aria-current="page">07 · Supported lifting</a><a href="../effective-log-iitaka-fourfolds/preview.ja.html">13 · Fourfold Iitaka</a><a href="../abundance-after-nonvanishing/preview.ja.html">14 · Kähler after nonvanishing</a></nav><article><h1>Lifting sections from the reduced support of an adjoint</h1>
+<p><strong>全被約台の生成性から、有限近傍の障害消滅と切断増大へ</strong></p>
+<p>OpenAI、2026年9月27日版、40ページ。公式カタログ034内の掲載順07。固定commit <code>adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a</code>。<a href="https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Lifting-sections-from-the-reduced-support-of-an-adjoint-September-27-2026/paper.pdf">原典</a>の主張を紹介するAI生成の概説であり、証明全体の正しさの認定ではない。重要な主張・証明は原典で確認されたい。</p>
+<p>随伴因子の有効倍数の被約台で切断が生成されるとき、そこから周囲の切断を増やすのが本稿の主題である。全被約台の gluing を保持し、frame bundle 上の正の重みを用いて有限近傍の持ち上げ障害を消す。得られるのは全次元の supported lifting であり、四次元の非消滅はその定理の仮定や証明には入らない。</p>
+<h2>主要結果（原典順、すべてp. 2）</h2>
+<h3>Theorem 1.1 — Supported boundary lifting</h3>
+<p><span class="math-inline">\((V,C)\)</span> を標数0の代数閉体上の normal projective <span class="math-inline">\(\mathbb Q\)</span>-factorial dlt 対とし、<span class="math-inline">\(C\)</span> は有効有理境界、<span class="math-inline">\(A=K_V+C\)</span> とする。十分可除な正整数 <span class="math-inline">\(q\)</span> と非零有効 Cartier 因子 <span class="math-inline">\(G\)</span> が
+<div class="math-display">\[0\ne G\ge0,\qquad G\sim qA,\qquad\operatorname{Supp}G\subseteq\operatorname{Supp}\lfloor C\rfloor\]</div>
+を満たすとする。<span class="math-inline">\(\mathcal O_V(G)|_{G_{\mathrm{red}}}\)</span> が<strong>全被約スキーム</strong>上で semiample なら <span class="math-inline">\(\kappa(V,A)&gt;0\)</span> である。<a href="https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Lifting-sections-from-the-reduced-support-of-an-adjoint-September-27-2026/paper.pdf">Theorem 1.1</a></p>
+<p>追加の nef 仮定はない。台の包含は真の包含でよく、<span class="math-inline">\(C=S+H+C_0\)</span>、<span class="math-inline">\(S=G_{\mathrm{red}}\)</span> と書いたとき、余分な係数1成分 <span class="math-inline">\(H\)</span> が <span class="math-inline">\(S\)</span> やその strata と交わることも許される。各正規化成分上の半豊富性だけを仮定に置き換えてはいけない。</p>
+<h3>Theorem 1.2 — Abundance after nonvanishing</h3>
+<p><span class="math-inline">\((X,\Delta)\)</span> を複素射影 lc 対、<span class="math-inline">\(\dim X\le4\)</span>、<span class="math-inline">\(\Delta\)</span> を有効有理境界とする。<span class="math-inline">\(D=K_X+\Delta\)</span> が <span class="math-inline">\(\mathbb Q\)</span>-Cartier、nef、<span class="math-inline">\(\kappa(X,D)\ge0\)</span> なら <span class="math-inline">\(D\)</span> は semiample。さらに <span class="math-inline">\(\kappa(X,D)=0\)</span> なら <span class="math-inline">\(D\sim_{\mathbb Q}0\)</span>。この結果は一様な指数を与えない。標数0の任意の代数閉体への移行は別掲の Corollary 7.2（p. 29）である。<a href="https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Lifting-sections-from-the-reduced-support-of-an-adjoint-September-27-2026/paper.pdf">Theorem 1.2、Corollary 7.2</a></p>
+<h3>Theorem 1.3 — Reduction to smooth canonical nonvanishing</h3>
+<p><strong>全次元</strong>の滑らかな連結複素射影多様体 <span class="math-inline">\(W\)</span> について、<span class="math-inline">\(K_W\)</span> が擬有効ならある <span class="math-inline">\(m&gt;0\)</span> で <span class="math-inline">\(H^0(W,mK_W)\ne0\)</span> と仮定する。この前提の下、標数0の任意の代数閉体上の normal projective lc 対 <span class="math-inline">\((X,\Delta)\)</span>、有効有理境界 <span class="math-inline">\(\Delta\)</span>、nef <span class="math-inline">\(\mathbb Q\)</span>-Cartier 随伴因子 <span class="math-inline">\(D=K_X+\Delta\)</span> に対し <span class="math-inline">\(D\)</span> は semiample となる。前提は nef な標準因子だけに限定されない。<a href="https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Lifting-sections-from-the-reduced-support-of-an-adjoint-September-27-2026/paper.pdf">Theorem 1.3</a></p>
+<h3>Corollary 1.4 — Fourfold log abundance</h3>
+<p>標数0の代数閉体上の normal projective lc 対 <span class="math-inline">\((X,\Delta)\)</span>、<span class="math-inline">\(\dim X\le4\)</span>、有効有理境界、<span class="math-inline">\(D=K_X+\Delta\)</span> が nef <span class="math-inline">\(\mathbb Q\)</span>-Cartier なら <span class="math-inline">\(D\)</span> は semiample。<span class="math-inline">\(\kappa(X,D)=0\)</span> なら <span class="math-inline">\(D\sim_{\mathbb Q}0\)</span>。ここで初めて <a href="https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Fourfold-nonvanishing-by-minimal-metrics-and-moving-jets-September-27-2026/paper.pdf">NV</a> Corollary 1.2 の四次元 lc 非消滅を追加する。<a href="https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Lifting-sections-from-the-reduced-support-of-an-adjoint-September-27-2026/paper.pdf">Corollary 1.4、証明p. 29</a></p>
